Z||000000||Chris McDonald||08-26-2001||06:25 PM||||Some of you that know me know I have not spent much time here in awhile.  Since I sold the V8 Fiero, I have had my hands full with a 69 Corvette project.<P>I upgraded my photo account a few weeks ago and am slowly getting my car photos up. When I get a chance, I will scan in all the V8 Fiero restoration and conversion pics.  I have about 100 of those.  <P>In the mean time, enjoy.<P>Chris<P>BTW-just finished putting the entire 69 in primer today.  Next step is the guide coat and 100's of hours hand sanding.<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1428880&f=0" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1428880&f=0</A> <P>||||reg||1
