Z||000003||Chris McDonald||08-27-2001||05:04 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by KissMySSFiero:<BR><B>are you going to get another fiero?  <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The next one has to have certain things.<P>V6, T-tops, 5 speed, low miles.<P>I don't have the time or energy to take on another complete rebuild of anything right now.  I have had my eye on a couple of different ones around town.  Price has not been right for me.  <P>We will see.<P>||||reg||1
